      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon his heowum in fæsten flæsc gefe, frigne ge þeowne halsfange alyse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person gives his household meat in a fast, let him redeem both free and slave with healsfang.</ab>
